  <dialog>k__BackingField:
  - text: 'Walter ? Is that you ? '
    isPlayer: 1
  - text: 'Hello, can i help you ? '
    isPlayer: 0
  - text: Oh ! Sorry I thought you were someone else...
    isPlayer: 1
  - text: I'm looking for my son, Walter, we lived here before we were split by the
      Wall
    isPlayer: 1
  - text: 'I''m the one liing here right now... '
    isPlayer: 0
  - text: But i don't know where he went after he left...
    isPlayer: 0
  - text: Oh ! Wait, i had this thing he left on the table when i moved in... Let
      me  give it to you
    isPlayer: 0
  - text: Well i guess it's quite normal he does'nt live here anymore... It's been
      so long
    isPlayer: 1
  - text: At least i know where i'm headed next
    isPlayer: 1
